sentences.t:
Hic regina gravem gemmis auroque poposcit
implevitque mero pateram, quam Belus et omnes
a Belo soliti;

sentences.l:
Here the queen called for a cup heavy with gems and gold,
and filled it with unmixed wine, which Belus and all
from Belus were wont to use;

sentences.t:
Dixit, et in mensam laticum libavit honorem,
primaque, libato, summo tenus attigit ore,
tum Bitiae dedit increpitans;

sentences.l:
She spoke, and on the table poured the honour of liquid,
and first, the libation made, with the edge of her mouth she touched it,
then gave it to Bitias, urging him on;

sentences.t:
Nec non et vario noctem sermone trahebat
infelix Dido, longumque bibebat amorem,
multa super Priamo rogitans, super Hectore multa;

sentences.l:
Nor less with varied talk the night she was drawing out,
unhappy Dido, and drinking long love,
asking many things about Priam, many about Hector;

sentences.t:
“Immo age, et a prima dic, hospes, origine nobis
“insidias, inquit, Danaum, casusque tuorum,
erroresque tuos;

sentences.l:
“Nay come, and from the first beginning tell us, guest,
“the treachery, she says, of the Danaans, and the fate of your own people,
and your wanderings;
